# Verify before done

"Done" means checked against the source, not "the script ran". Every past
error in this project ran without an exception.

Run only the sections that apply to what changed. Report what you ran and
what you skipped. Never claim a check you did not run.

## 1. Data claims

For every number, availability claim or chart that reaches César:

- [ ] **"Not available" claims.** Did you retry without `interval` and `fields`, and search the RIC with `lseg.data.discovery.search()`? Is the Workspace proxy on `localhost:9000` actually up? Empty or timeout means "not verified", not "blocked".
- [ ] **Field.** The field is declared explicitly per instrument class (`MID_YLD_1`, `MID_PRICE`, `TRDPRC_1`, `CF_LAST`). No fallback loop picked it.
- [ ] **Currency.** Any market cap, revenue or EV compared across countries was pulled with `Curn=USD`.
- [ ] **Units.** Mixed-unit formulas (e.g. $/gal vs $/bbl) are converted. Spot-check one value against Workspace or a public quote.
- [ ] **Aggregation.** Group multiples are harmonic (sum MV / sum earnings). Price decomposition is multiplicative.
- [ ] **Sanity print.** Print the 3 largest and 3 smallest values of any new series. Anything off by orders of magnitude is a units or currency bug.
- [ ] **Direction vs level.** Any "rose/fell" wording is backed by the time series, not by a percentile or a single snapshot.

## 2. Portfolio

- [ ] Holdings came from the latest IBKR file (`config.ultimo_estado()` or the backend ingest), never from memory, a skill or a screenshot.
- [ ] Sections with more than one Header row were parsed by block.
- [ ] The return label matches the math: TWR vs return on cost vs market return. No mixing.

## 3. Code changes

- [ ] Every string patch (`.replace`, `re.sub`) asserts it matched.
- [ ] Python: `python -m py_compile` on touched files, then run the touched script end to end against live data and read its output.
- [ ] Backend: start `uvicorn main:app` and hit the touched endpoints; check `/health`.
- [ ] Frontend: `npm run build` in `frontend/` (type errors surface here) and load the touched page in the browser pane, both themes.
- [ ] No new absolute path outside `engine/config.py`. No secret outside `.env`.

## 4. Output

- [ ] Deck/dashboard text: English, Arial, no em-dashes, few colons.
- [ ] Every number in generated prose was injected from JSON, not written by the model.
- [ ] Charts follow `engine/paleta.md`: red only for reference lines, no green/red for sign, max 6 series. Open the PNG and look at it.
- [ ] Images placed in the deck match the placeholder aspect (save without `bbox_inches="tight"` when sizing matters).

## Report format

End with one line per section: `ran` / `skipped (why)` / `failed (what)`.
If anything failed, the task is not done.
